				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<header>
<div class="byline">By <a href="http://www.fastcompany.com/3045999/like-a-boss-how-madonna-became-the-biggest-pop-brand-on-the-planet" target="_blank">FastCo Studios</a></div>
</header>
<div class="row collapse">
<div class="body prose article-prose twelve columns">
<p>Three decades after exploding on the scene, <strong>Madonna</strong>&#8216;s star continues to shine bright—and being lucky is only part of the reason why. She went from wide-eyed new New Yorker with only $35 in her pocket to the <strong>biggest pop star on the planet</strong>. Along the way, she pissed off everyone from Sean Penn to the Pope. <strong>There is and always will be only one Madonna</strong>.<br />
Watch the video above and check how she got into her career groove—and why <strong>she&#8217;s staying there forever</strong>.</p>
</div>
</div>
